# The build needs go.mod, go.sum, the Go source and LICENSE. Everything else
# only invalidates the COPY . . layer, and with it the compile of 120 indirect
# dependencies -- so a README edit would otherwise cost a full rebuild.
#
# .git matters most since the release workflow clones full history to read the
# tag message.
.git
.github
bin
Dockerfile
Makefile
README.md
